{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9f3e61b7b4a912a029e441689bf628040d06db5b935492abf05698942b0bff1f", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ！\n撮影が始まる前に、紬の様子を……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》！\n在拍摄开始前，先看看紬的情况……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a53a952e9e986327d908e896ba632ebcf28b36996bb7718ae5631595ccedeec9", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n少々よろしいですか……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n可以占用您一点时间吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0a4f1461e89524a2d8ee0c4f0f5389b3548984c749042f8219eab314f2beafb3", "ja": "どうした、紬？\n何か気になることでもあったのか？", "zh": "怎么了，紬？\n是有什么在意的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7d0b9f1a0fd748e6b3bded5d40b6666d0eeaa02910f9322eb45a2151f1ecfb22", "ja": "ええ。お衣装もセットも、とても素敵なものを\n用意していただきましたが……", "zh": "是的。无论是服装还是布景，您都为我准备了非常棒的东西，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eb14512c91826d7a1f881e2861542460691f1aeddefe714a8b6e4b7b35d10a06", "ja": "私がこのお衣装を着るには、\n時期尚早なのではないかと思ったのです。", "zh": "我觉得，对我来说穿上这套服装，\n现在还为时过早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1005_p", "source_sha256": "92ddf3c9aa70b20ebea98a5ef1a6ce93aba8ff050c983e4b603f5ba2d244d076", "ja": "えっ？　そんなことはないと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶？我觉得没这回事吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0440a6e738099357d12e3e8ba42dbd25677e1ad17f468b0309af43f1c338d15e", "ja": "本気でそう思っているのですか？\n……そ、そんなにジロジロと見んといて！", "zh": "您真的这么想吗？\n……别、别一直盯着我看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fc3139592eacea8bce0a81aed5bf6cc00a048286ee74f58d958ba0736c52c6b9", "ja": "あ、いや……すまん。", "zh": "啊，不，没什么……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b82e42bf02d4b8c196dd1cfa125700ce9fa48d0f196226b60067cc3c47c552a9", "ja": "私がこのお衣装に見劣りしていないと？　あなたは\nパジャマのコンセプトをもう忘れたのですか？", "zh": "我真的配得上这套服装吗？　你\n难道已经忘了睡衣的主题概念了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dbe2e982e8dfcfdd9c55bcb606583a1ec7e7a95cc14526f05655508e6dee4139", "ja": "ちゃんと覚えてるよ。\nそのパジャマのコンセプトは『セクシー』だ。", "zh": "我当然记得。那套睡衣的主题就是“性感”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "862052ca7eddc926902a47d12b322ff4c538a9e9cacfe2fcefc53a9aca3f12db", "ja": "ええ、そうです。\n他の方ならいざしらず、私にセクシーな魅力など……。", "zh": "嗯，是的。其他人暂且不说，我可没有什么性感魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "556f858fe003c6edd99786d9693d68bc3abf50b29b11d6af1d81228214ef238a", "ja": "そうかな？　紬の落ち着いた佇まいは\n大人っぽく見えるからな。うん、大丈夫！", "zh": "是吗？纺那沉稳的举止看起来很成熟。嗯，没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "752f4243aa0d6eb04d5ecb57d7287de4faf35a39d07e868bceae8c595611a326", "ja": "あ、あなたは根拠もなくそのようなことを！\n私だって、いつまでもその手には……。", "zh": "啊，你怎么能毫无根据地说这种话！\n我才不会永远都上你的当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c5d20c0dc2fbe5cc8edcfed4959012f530f2374d0e422412e0d22aaf9f50c342", "ja": "違うって！　その衣装が紬に似合うって、\n本気で思ったから選んだんだ！", "zh": "不是的！我是因为真的觉得那套服装很适合紬，才选的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bdd0325a37ce7566a1817ad484b01cddb02b5caabfd77dbde5317f606cce673d", "ja": "なっ……！　うちのこと、そんな風に……。\n……ほ、本当に信じてもよろしいのですか？", "zh": "什……！居然那样看待我……  \n……真、真的可以相信您吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6c9a28d698e4766d07ffc7624f241cbdbe789f104b1bcd22f75ddc88bb49a47f", "ja": "もちろんだ！\nちゃんと事実を言ってる。信じてほしい。", "zh": "当然了！\n我说的都是事实，希望你能相信我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f8c1e709a87d88e077069b8bc67a71c6eff812f12b0483fab5f4f07da201d28b", "ja": "自信たっぷりに言われたら、\n信じるしかないじゃないですか……ふふっ。", "zh": "被说得那么自信满满，我也只能相信了呀……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0658ccb7bbe52e1fbfbba41f5d9e15bf724ea2c7ed3bfd1c2efb71eea305931c", "ja": "わかりました。その言葉を信じて、最善を尽くします。\nあなたは責任をもって、見届けてくださいまし！", "zh": "我知道了。我相信你说的话，全力以赴。\n请你负起责任，好好见证到最后吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0233_1018_p", "source_sha256": "da32312759cefad604ec3a0e55354d37054145c74c39fd5e6dee522b8769694b", "ja": "（最善を尽くした紬は、良い表情を連発していた。\nこれは写真の出来上がりが楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（拼尽全力的纺，接连露出了很棒的表情。真期待照片洗出来啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
